window.products.push({"id":612002,"name":"\"Tropic Orange\" Orange Candy Concentrate Powder Pigment 5g | Automotive Grade Paint Colorant | Solvent Dye | Candy Paint | DIY Arts/Crafts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81b8QeBOdpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5g Dye Pigment. Results shown over a silver base. Automotive Application: Mix into REDUCER ONLY first. This powder must be dissolved in a solvent prior to mixing with any clear medium. Stir in reducer/solvent and allow powder to fully dissolve, then you can filter the solution into an intercoat clear / clear base / or another clear carrier. Apply 2-4 coats over the base (more coats will darken the color). Finish with top coat clear. Mixing Ratio: 20g to 1 ready to spray gallon. Use for bikes, cars, trucks, hobbies and crafts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81b8QeBOdpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Didspade","source_asin":"B00LDCCRHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-612002","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LDCCRHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LDCCRHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
