window.products.push({"id":612249,"name":"Velvet Dining Chairs Set of 4,Upholstered Dining Chairs with Gold Metal Legs,Blue Velvet Chairs for Dining Room,Kitchen,Living Room,Dresser","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tFvNo+dSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Modern Dining Chairs】These blue velvet chairs have a cute shape and unique shell head design, suitable for use in dining room and kitchen, and also a good choice to use with dressing table. These chairs are versatile and the gold coating on the legs brings a modern touch to your home and complements any home style. 【Premium Material】The velvet fabric provides a soft and delicate touch and does not irritate the skin. The backrest and seat cushion of navy dining room chairs are filled with high-density sponge, which has good resilience and is not easy to collapse even if you sit for a long time. These navy dining room chairs will work well for many years and give you the best experience. 【STRONG CONSTRUCTION】The sturdy metal frame has a stable structure, the four heavy duty metal legs are very strong, won't break easily like inferior wooden legs and won't easily shake after installation, these blue vanity chairs have an overall weight capacity of 300 lbs. Rubber feet on top of the legs protect your floor and adjust to accommodate uneven surfaces. 【Easy to Install】The package sent to you contains detailed installation instructions and necessary installation parts, you only need to spend two minutes to read the installation instructions, and it will take about 5 minutes to complete the installation work. Dimensions of each chair: 20''L*19''W*30.3''H 【After-sale service】We provide two-year warranty, free return for quality problems, if you are not satisfied with our products, please feel free to contact us, we will reply within 24 hours. We will provide you with the best service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tFvNo+dSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VrixTT","source_asin":"B09VC4QSXK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-612249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VC4QSXK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VC4QSXK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":612250,"name":"Hebayy 30 Non Slip Flowers Bathtub Stickers, Waterproof and Anti Skid for Shower and Bathtub with Premium Scraper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9177bGOxE8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Various Design: 30 Pcs adorable water-resistance flowers cartoon stickers with 10 colors in a gift box (10 big stickers and 20 smaller). Perfect for motivating children while taking a bath and adding a lot of fun. Premium Quality: Made from premium glue plus original PEVA particle with permanent adhesive, keeping your decor bright and shiny for a long lifespan. Sanitary care & safety use is our first priority, so these stickers are skin friendly and coated with anti-slip film. Easy to Use: Suitable for any smooth surface bathtubs. Make sure the tub surface is dried before applying these fun items. Peel off and stick wherever you want, done! Let stand for several hours so they could adhere more strongly to the tub. Thanks to the specialized ecological glue, stickers can also be easily removed by an attached scraper and leave no residue. Strong Slip-Resistant Effect: Durable and good quality plastic for lasting use, bath stickers can adhere to most smooth and non-porous surfaces. It has great grip, and it is a good option for someone looking not to slip in the tub and stay safe. Enjoyable Bath Time: These colorful and elegant stickers will lead our beloved kids’ into a fun plant world. They would have a lot of fun with these cartoon patterns. During the bath time, they could learn more about the flowers and furthermore, play with them such as story talking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9177bGOxE8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hebayy","source_asin":"B08YDFYD3M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-612250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YDFYD3M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YDFYD3M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
