window.products.push({"id":612359,"name":"Anolon Advanced Nonstick Hard-Anodized Aluminum 1/2-Quart Mini Au Gratins, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31PQDNP9QEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Among the most prized cookware materials, hard-anodized aluminum offers the dual advantage of quick, even heating and long-lasting durability. This set of two mini oval au gratins from Anolon proudly boasts these features, but adds an Autograph nonstick coating inside and out for effortless food release and simple cleanup. The result, a striking piece that cooks efficiently on the stovetop, yet looks perfectly at home in a gourmet kitchen. Offering deep sides and a 1/2-quart capacity, the cookware can be used for both baking and serving--the au gratins work great for hot artichoke dip, baked figs with honey glaze, and quiche, even individual servings of sizzling shrimp scampi. The hard-anodized aluminum construction not only heats quickly, but also eliminates \"hot spots\" that plague cheaper cookware due to its thick side and bottom walls. Like many other Anolon cookware lines, Anolon Advanced features the company's patented SureGrip handles, which are a combination of 18/10 stainless steel and silicone rubber and are riveted to the sides for durability. In addition, the ergonomic handles provide a comfortable, confident grip and stay cool on the stovetop for easy control. Oven-safe to 400 degrees F, the cookware should be washed by hand with a mild cleanser. Each mini au gratin measures 7 by 5 inches and carries a limited lifetime warranty against defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31PQDNP9QEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anolon","source_asin":"B000FDP0XO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-612359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000FDP0XO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000FDP0XO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
