window.products.push({"id":612388,"name":"Tubby Buddie Bath Pillow and Tub Cushion | Bathtub Padded Pillow, Rest, Wedge for Neck and Back Support | Comfortable and Relaxing | Gifts for Women","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I4lNnqgBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Relax while having the most comfortable bath Feel your neck aching while you're relaxing in your bathtub? Are you tired of having your backache after a few minutes in the Tub? Our new bath pillow for the warm soaking tub will provide the most relaxing experience while bathing. Have the perfect bath spa session with this unique and luxury TUBBY BUDDY bath mat pillow. It offers everything you need to help you fully relax while bathing. Made with soft, environmentally friendly TPE foam, it has the same material as a yoga mat. Imagine the relaxing sensation of stretching on a comfortable yoga mat, while in your bathtub! Multipurpose Experience all the benefits of having a pillow while you relax in your bathtub. If you want to rest your head comfortably, place the mat on top of the bathtub and rest on the soft and luxurious foam pillow. If you want to have a comfortable seat, place the mat below your legs and relax. This mat is also tear-resistant. You can effortlessly move it wherever feels most comfortable Anti Slip This bath mat pillow has 48 suction cups that keep this non-slip mat in place no matter where it's placed in the bathtub. These powerful suction cups allow you to reposition the mattress wherever you want. When this mat sinks into the bathtub, squeeze it again to remove all the air. This will attach this bath mat firmly to the bathtub, keeping you in the right place! Store Easily Storage and maintenance couldn't be simpler. Just stick this bath pillow against the wall and let it drip dry. The bathtub mat will deform and it does not take up too much space. The best bath of your life TUBBY BUDDIE makes your 20 minutes of me time in the bathtub just right! You can sip your favorite beverage and your legs can simply relax. This bathtub mat won't move anywhere! Enjoy!!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I4lNnqgBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tubby Buddie","source_asin":"B08R6D1PB2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-612388","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R6D1PB2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R6D1PB2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
