window.products.push({"id":612498,"name":"Built by Briick Quilting The LadderRack 2-in-1 Quilt Display Rack (5 Rung/24 Model/Whitewash)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SsrU6kmML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Display your quilts in style! The LadderRack is a versatile quilt display rack that adjusts to suit your needs and space allowance. You can have it folded in an A-frame next to your couch or lean it against the wall in ladder form so everyone can admire your artistic work. This specially designed quilt rack allows for your quilts to hang freely without pushing the ladder away from the wall, even when using the top rung for display. Whichever way you choose to use it, you will not be disappointed with how beautiful your quilts look hanging on it! Our 5 Rung 24\" Model Features: 5 1/2 ft. Tall, 5 reinforced rounded hanging rungs that can hold up to 10 lbs. each and won't damage your quilts or blankets, 6\" deep shelf at the bottom for storage or display items, and a hand stained/hand rubbed smooth satin poly finish. Non-slip pads for floors and walls included, Handmade in the USA from clear (no knot) premium pine, Product Dimensions: Ladder Form: H:67 1/2\" x W:24\" - A-frame: 33 1/2\" x 24\". Interior rung display allowance: 22 1/2\". distance from the wall at the bottom is approximately 22\". A footprint of 2' x 2' floor space is required. *Assembly Required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SsrU6kmML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Built by Briick Quilting","source_asin":"B07CH9FMFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-612498","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CH9FMFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CH9FMFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":612499,"name":"Fake Greenery Garlands Artificial Silver Dollar Eucalyptus Garland in Grey Green and Willow Twigs Garland Intertwined Together for Rustic Wedding Arch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sdLsRJYiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Mixed Eucalyptus and Willow Garland for Fall Thanksgiving Decoration Eucalyptus Pumpkin Garland Centerpiece/Table Runner: Pair the eucalyptus garland with orange plaid table runner, artificial pumpkins, metallic candle holders, to create a festive arrangement. Mixed Eucalyptus and Willow Garland for Wedding Decoration Make a Mixed Eucalyptus Willow Wreath or Candle Ring Dress up your wedding chairs or Pew with a Mixed Eucalyptus and Willow Garland. Combine eucalyptus and willow garland with flowers that match the decor on your wedding cake On A Wedding Ceremony Arch Tying Back A Curtain Wedding Greenery Table Runner Garland Eucalyptus Garland for Home Indoor Outdoor Decoration Place the mixed eucalyptus and willow garland on the fireplace mantel, drape over mirrors, windows, framed pictures, wind around pillars, railings, gazebos, banisters, trellis, pergola, arrange atop cabinets, or hang from ceiling and wall. - Decorate bedroom, living room, garden, balcony, kitchen, dining room and more. Great for VBS Safari Jungle Party Decoration Combine the eucalyptus garland and Willow garland for Jungle Party backdrop. Hang eucalyptus garland and Willow garland from walls, doors, entryways or in front of the dessert table. Use as jungle party greenery table runner garland. Great for Spring Summer Season Decoration: Combine the eucalyptus garland and Willow garland with seasonal flowers to make a eucalyptus wreath, such as peony for spring or sunflower for summer. Mixed Eucalyptus and Willow Garland for Holiday Christmas Decoration Eucalyptus willow greenery and other holiday plants to make holiday table runner. Drape the eucalyptus garland around your fireplace mantel, down your stairway banister, or around an entryway for near-instant natural and merry-making look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sdLsRJYiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Supla","source_asin":"B07YQWC2NR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-612499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YQWC2NR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YQWC2NR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
