window.products.push({"id":612543,"name":"iSPECLE Dish Drying Rack, 304 Stainless Steel 2-Tier Dish Rack with Utensil Holder, Cutting Board Holder and Dish Drainer for Kitchen Counter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ltaT-dS4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Maximize Your Kitchen Space: With this two tier dish drying rack, you can store up to 17 plates and pots on the upper shelf and 18 bowls on the lower shelf. It also comes with a side rack for utensils and another side for cutting boards. Ideal for small kitchens that want more room to work. NOTE: This is a Small Dish Rack No More Rust: This dish rack 2 tier is made of 304 stainless steel, which prevents rusting and lasts longer. It’s a small dish rack that measures 16.6 × 10.2 × 16.1 inches, perfect for a small family. Note: if you see any “rust” on the rack, it’s just water scale. You can wipe it off easily Solid Rack and Adjustable Feet: The kitchen dish drying rack features a square tube and “H” shaped frame design, which ensures it’s stable and balanced. It can support up to 110 lb of dishes. Note: if the rack is shaky or doesn’t sit flat on the counter, you can adjust the height of the feet to make it even Keep Counter Dry: This dish drainers for kitchen counter has 3 slide-out trays underneath to catch any water from the dishes. They’re easy to clean and keep your counter from getting wet. Easy to Assemble: This stainless steel dish rack comes with instructions and is simple to put together. You or your kid can do it in minutes and save time. Note: Make sure you have at least 23.6 inches of space between your counter and cabinet for the plates to fit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ltaT-dS4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iSPECLE","source_asin":"B07WGK7DT4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-612543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WGK7DT4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WGK7DT4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
