window.products.push({"id":612603,"name":"THXSILK 100% Silk Pillowcase for Hair and Skin, Both Sides Grade 6A+ Mulberry Silk Pillow Case with Hidden Zipper, Soft & Smooth White Pillowcases(1pc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AyzYHSEqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% MULBERRY SILK: THXSILK pillowcase is made of 100% long strand, Grade 6A+ Pure Mulberry Silk, which is smooth, soft and antistatic, maintains the balance of skin moisture. Compared with satin polyester, pure silk is a more organic fiber with relatively low carbon footprint, low soil and low land impact. It is composed of animal proteins and contains 18 kinds of Amino acids that are believed to effectively improve skin conditions. BENEFITS FOR HAIR, SKIN AND SLEEP: A natural silk pillowcase allows your hair and skin to glide effortlessly along the surface of your pillow. Less friction helps reduce hair breakage and promotes skin smooth. Comfortable and breathable, pure mulberry silk is also a natural temperature regulator, which helps maintaining the correct body temperature. It keeps you feel cool in summer and warm in winter. CONCEALED ZIPPER + DURABILITY: Concealed zipper design keeps the pillowcase seamless and uniform, prevents your pillow from moving around during the night and makes it easy to slip the pillow in and out for frustration-free washing. The pillowcase has exquisite craftsmanship of the neat stitches, and durable plain color which is not easy to fade after washing. GREAT GIFT CHOICE: Carefully wrapped in a gift package, the silk pillowcase is an ideal present to be given to your loved ones for any holidays such as Valentine's Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas and New Year festivals, as well as special occasions like weddings, bridal and baby showers, birthdays, anniversaries. etc. We offer a wide range of colors and sizes to fit your taste. (Standard: 20\"x26\", Queen: 20\"x30\", King: 20\"x36\") WASHING INSTRUCTIONS: Hand-washing with cool water and dry clean are preferred. You can also put the pillowcase in a washing machine set to the gentle cycle, and we suggest to use a mesh wash bag when do so. Lay flat to dry. If you have any problem with the silk pillowcase, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AyzYHSEqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THXSILK","source_asin":"B0BVLDPSY3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-612603","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVLDPSY3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVLDPSY3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
