window.products.push({"id":612649,"name":"Dafeel Cooling Pillow for Kids, Boys, Girls, Students (Aged 5-12),【Easy to Clean】 Soft & Heavy Pillow for Side Back Stomach Sleepers with Nice Pillowc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ty1IxMHqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💟【Designed For 5-12 Years Old Kids】Taking into account the body and sleeping habits of child. The Dafeel cooling pillow heights are 3.14 and 3.93 inches on both sides, it will keep your neck and body in a straight line disperses the pressure on the cervical spine and head. 😪【Low Profile Pillow】Dafeel Wave Pillow is small size and low height than standard pillow, that's the main reason why it's not suitable for adults. 😴【Evolution of Material】Dafeel Wave Pillow is made of high elastic TPE material that ensures meet high safety and environmental standards. The Pillow cover is made of skin-friendly material to stay soft and breathable. 💤【Sleeps Cool】Hundreds of airflow channels to quickly release heat, allowing you to stay comfortable and cool all night long. Experiencing pain, snoring or sweaty are all signs of sleeping wrong. Our pillows help you sleep better than ever. 🏋️【Pretty Heavy Yet Ultra-Durable】Dafeel Wave Pillow is 7.2 LB. It's heavier than other kinds of pillows. So it can be fixed on the bed very well. And won’t be moved casually in deep sleep. It can keep its shape night after night. 💟【One Year Protection for Peace of Mind】We provide one year protection for Dafeel Wave Pillow. If you have any issues, please feel free to contact us via message.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ty1IxMHqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dafeel","source_asin":"B09M9VWZ3G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-612649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M9VWZ3G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M9VWZ3G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
