window.products.push({"id":612896,"name":"GOLDEN SUN Waterproof Fabric Shower Curtain for Bathroom,Colorful Funny Bathroom Curtains with Standard Size 72 x 72 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hPGQ0eHXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We supply a well made shower curtain at an affordable price. Material: It is made of high quality durable microfiber fabric, 100% polyester, dries quickly (It dried off quickly and didn't leave watermarks on the fabric).  It brightens up the bathroom and can accommodate many colors of decor. Features: Colorful shower curtain 72 inches x 72 inches easily fits any standard size shower / tub and works with straight or curved shower rods. 12pcs grommets along reinforced top-header prevent the top holes from ripping. It comes with 12pcs plastic hooks by free. Summarize： 1. shower curtain!2. Set Includes: shower curtain × 1, plastic curtain hooks × 12.3. Product Dimension: 72 x 72 Inch4. Large digital printed design is with vibrant colors, clear image, no fading.5. 12pcs grommets along reinforced top-header.6. Easy install and care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hPGQ0eHXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOLDEN SUN","source_asin":"B07DCBGWX6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-612896","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DCBGWX6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DCBGWX6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
