window.products.push({"id":612985,"name":"YULINK 2.5x3.5 Small Vintage Picture Frame, Mini Antique Ornate Bronze Gold Photo Frame, for Tabletop and Wall Display, Decorative Retro Home Decor, O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ro7kAapdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ELEGANT VINTAGE DESIGN - The small vintage 2.5x3.5 picture frame has a charming shape and detailed floral design with artistic Victorian embellishments, making it a beautiful way to display your favorite wallet size pictures, portraits, landscapes, art prints, especially black and white or more formal ones. The pretty little frame keeps your precious memories, and also adds a nice touch of luxury to your decor. PREMIUM QUALITY - The antique mini picture frame 2.5 x 3.5 is well made of environmental resin, includes high definition glass to protect your photo or painting. Beautiful and unique hand painted in a gorgeous antique bronze gold color. It has a traditional black velvet back, with a firm easel and hooks to match. Simply flip the turn buttons on the back and insert a photo. TABLETOP OR WALL MOUNT - This ornate tiny picture frame 2.5 by 3.5 can rest either horizontally or vertically on any desktop, shelf, or dresser. It also has two hooks for easy mounting on a wall in portrait and landscape orientation. The cute antique style frame looks like a work of art, adds a sense of old-world feeling to your home, office, studio or gallery wall. GREAT FOR GIFTS - This lovely frame is such an ideal gift for anyone who loves old family photos or antique pieces. Whether for a wedding, housewarming, birthday, anniversary, Christmas, Father's Day, Mother's Day or other occasions, this adorable frame delightfully combines sentimental value, practical use, and decorative splendor. Gift it to baby, a best friend, grandma, grandpa, dad, mom, etc. PERFECT SIZE - The retro picture frame's overall dimensions are 3.8\" x 4.8\" and it is intended to display 2.5\" x 3.5\" photos. This kind of classy frame is available in multiple sizes (2.5x3.5, 4x6, 5x7, and 8x10). Choose the right fit that best meets your needs and personal taste. See the love in the photo of this fancy frame.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ro7kAapdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YULINK","source_asin":"B0BLCXZJGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-612985","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLCXZJGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLCXZJGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
